Probe B: unit-minus-one clocks as periodic-point counts
==============================================================================
  j <= 60: |det(A^j - I)| = |L_j - 1 - (-1)^j| = |F(2,j)^ab| (Spectre monodromy order) and tr(A^j) = L_j = #Fix(golden shift^j): ALL OK
  so #Fix(cat^j) = #Fix(shift^j) - (1 + (-1)^j): the two shift points lost for even j are 0^inf and the 2-cycle (01)^inf
